      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are two reported issues here, so I'll address each individually.\n\n> \"The performance ranking details both in-game and in the SDK are miscalculating the constraint depth to be equal to the total number of constraints, regardless of the actual constraint depth\"\n\nWe are aware of an existing issue in SDK 3.7.0 where the constraint depth is calculated and shown correctly by the SDK, but incorrectly in the client. The beta version 3.7.1-beta.1 and later should resolve this specific issue.\n\nIf you are seeing a case where the SDK is miscalculating constraint depth, please can you give more information about the configuration you're using to trigger that?\n\n> \"and the VRC constraints are no longer functioning on android\"\n\nThis is a known issue and is being tracked here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrchat-constraints-not-working-on-quest-since-update",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
